	XLIST	LSTFLG

/THE PARAMETERS DEFINED HEREIN CAN BE DEFINED HERE
/OR THEY CAN BE DEFINED IN THE PARAMETER FILE
/OR THEY CAN BE DEFINED DIRECTLY IN TTY.PA

/USERS WHO WISH TO USE MORE THAN ONE TTY HANDLER CAN MAKE
/MULTIPLE COPIES OF THIS CONTROL FILE, ONE FOR EACH TTY DRIVER DESIRED.
/THIS FILE IS INCLUDED BETWEEN PARAM.PA AND TTY.PA
/DURING AN ASSEMBLY.

/	TASK=		/TASK NAME FOR THIS COPY OF TTY HANDLER
			/DEFAULT IS 'TTY'
/	TTDEV=		/PRINTER DEVICE CODE - DEFAULT IS 04
/	KBDEV=		/KEYBOARD DEVICE CODE - DEFAULT IS TTDEV-1
/	CONSOL=		/1 MEANS CONSOLE TTY (DEFAULT)
/	VT50=		/1 ENABLES CTRL/S AND CTRL/Q
/	SCOPE=		/1 MEANS TTY CAN DO A BACKSPACE
/	FILL=		/NUMBER OF FILL CHARACTERS, I.E. 4
/	WIDTH=		/TTY LINE WIDTH (0 MEANS INFINITE), DEFAULT IS 120
/	TAB=		/1 IF TTY HAS HARDWARE TABS
/	OLDTTY=		/1 TO USE OLD 2-PAGE TTY HANDLER
/	LSBOT=		/1 LISTS BOTH HANDLERS (DEFAULT 0)
/	TTFLD=		/FIELD OF TTY TASK
/	TTLOC=		/LOCATION OF TTY TASK
